# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored — never commit real keys.

# --- Contact form --------------------------------------------------------
# The "Require more in-depth market research?" form on the Desktop Land
# Estimate sends through Resend. Without both of these the form still works
# and reports success, but logs the enquiry instead of sending it — so the
# page never fails in front of a prospect.
#
# Use the same Resend key as the portal. CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL must be on a
# domain verified in Resend; until investorproperty.co.za is verified there,
# onboarding@resend.dev works for testing and delivers only to your own
# Resend account address.
RESEND_API_KEY=
CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=estimate@investorproperty.co.za

# --- Reference database (estimate submissions) -----------------------------
# Records anonymous, non-identifying figures from each calculation — see
# supabase/schema.sql for exactly what and why. Run that file's SQL once
# against a Supabase project's SQL editor before this does anything.
#
# Reuse the SAME Supabase project the ConveyAssist portal already has
# (portal/.env.local) rather than creating a second one — keeps this on the
# free tier's project count instead of spending a second slot on it. Without
# both of these set, calculations still work exactly as before; nothing is
# recorded, and nothing fails.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# --- App ------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
